                        "review": "The game is abandoned. You will not be able to complete many of the missions due to the following:\n\n- Facebook Account required for some missions\n- Emails for characters are no longer working\n- Some websites are missing\n\nYou will only be able to see what this game WAS through a walkthrough guide. Any ability to solve many of the puzzles on your own are permanently broken. \n\nThere is no more immersion events. \n\nThe discord community is completely dead.\n\nIf you buy this in 2026 and beyond, get your refund. This game is broken.",
